{"synopsis":"Saya adalah Pope (Paus), dan menghabiskan 10 tahun menyelamatkan dunia dari ambang kehancuran.\n\nAku menghadapi dan mengatasi kematian berkali-kali untuk menyelamatkan dunia dan nyaris tidak kembali ke Bumi, tetapi kemudian…\n\n[Peringatan! Jika Anda tidak mencapai jumlah pengikut yang dibutuhkan dalam 90 hari, sistem Anda akan dimulai ulang!]\n\n“…Permisi?”\n\n“Ya?”\n\n“…Saya datang untuk menyebarkan firman Tuhan.”","alternative_title":"Please Stop Our Pope, 우리 교황님 좀 말려주세요","author":"Pamison","artist":"Lee Seom","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"6ea55425-18cd-460e-9211-1a7b2a0307f0","number":"78","chapter":"78","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02"},{"chapter_id":"0ee593f0-d9de-4f58-a54c-8515a19d6ba1","number":"77","chapter":"77","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02"},{"chapter_id":"ae9d4a02-2b9c-4f84-9646-d7d376d8ac19","number":"76","chapter":"76","title":"","date":"2026-07-14","released":"2026-07-14"},{"chapter_id":"049a1ad3-52d9-4e5e-81ba-35434de174b5","number":"75","chapter":"75","title":"","date":"2026-07-14","released":"2026-07-14"},{"chapter_id":"5e4b96a0-f573-48bc-82e0-54c30831d243","number":"74","chapter":"74","title":"","date":"2026-07-14","released":"2026-07-14"},{"chapter_id":"98e69527-03f7-4e6c-b1cd-7dfe9cce1cd4","number":"73","chapter":"73","title":"","date":"2026-07-01","released":"2026-07-01"},{"chapter_id":"60bfa72e-d901-4c1a-90db-0862cfa0e56f","number":"72","chapter":"72","title":"","date":"2026-07-01","released":"2026-07-01"},{"chapter_id":"b6585424-abd8-45af-8a3d-dddb52d5049a","number":"71","chapter":"71","title":"","date":"2026-07-01","released":"2026-07-01"},{"chapter_id":"be9b2148-d732-4352-ae23-c636ef653316","number":"70","chapter":"70","title":"","date":"2026-05-31","released":"2026-05-31"},{"chapter_id":"6807ca4c-6145-45cf-bb7b-4a05a25a7c72","number":"69","chapter":"69","title":"","date":"2026-05-20","released":"2026-05-20"},{"chapter_id":"2fc29355-f730-41ed-b85c-c5eb3e694dc8","number":"68","chapter